== Trivia ==
* Tiny Planet was [[boisite:99972667929/a-quicky|pitched as a cosmetic item]] in ''Team Fortress 2'', alongside {{I|Skatole}}, tears, and {{I|Brimstone}}. Only Brimstone made the cut.
* This item is used in {{chal|Head Trauma}}.
* The item is likely a reference to [[wikipedia:Asteroids|asteroids]], or possibly dwarf planets.

